{title: Bas Ek Baar}
{artist: Soham Naik}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Meri nazron ko tune [Dm]sapna dikhaya,        [F]Jagaya [G]mujhe raaton [C]mein
[C]Dabi dabi saansome [Dm]khushbu le aaya,        [F]Kabhi jo naa [G]thi raahon [C]mein
Aisa mera [F]dil kabhi na tha,        [C]Jaisa yeh ho gaya
[Dm]Karamaat teri hai [F]yeh,        Bas [C]ek baar tumko [Dm]dekhne ko tarsu
[F]Maano na [G]kehna [C]mera,        Main toh bas [C]ek baar
tumko [Dm]dekhne ko tarsun,        [F]Kehta hai [G]dil yeh [C]mera
[Am] [Em] [F]x2,        [C]Aate aate [Am]tum le aana
[Dm]Be mausam ki kuch [G]baarishe yahan,        [C]Aadhe aadhe [Am]bheege dono hon
[Dm]Phir apni kuch [G]khwahishein riha,        Aisa mera [F]dil kabhi na tha
[C]Hairaan bewajah,        [Dm]Saugaat teri hai [F]yeh
Bas [C]ek baar tumko [Dm]dekhne ko tarsu,        [F]Kehta hai [G]dil yeh [C]mera
Haan bas [C]ek baar tumko,        [Dm]dekhne ko tarsun
[F]Kehta hai [G]dil yeh [C]mera,        [C] [Em] [F] [G]
[C]Baithe baithe [Am]soche tumko,        Do [Dm]ankhein hi [G]bunti kahaniyaan
[C]Hanste hanste [Am]baatein karte,        Ik [Dm]dooje se [G]khwaabon ke darmiyaan
Aisa mera [F]dil kabhi na tha,        Is [C]baar ho gaya
[Dm]Khurafat teri hai [F]yeh,        Bas [C]ek baar tumko [Dm]dekhne ko tarsun
[F]Kehta hai [G]dil yeh [C]mera,        Haan bas [C]ek baar tumko
[Dm]dekhne ko tarsu,        [F]Maano na [G]kehna [C]mera
Main toh bas [C]ek baar tumko,        [Dm]dekhne ko tarsun
[F]Kehta hai [G]dil yeh [C]mera
